UID:oAkymeOwfqqwOCj41f_JN
SUMMARY:Catastrophic Theatre: Tamarie’s Greatest Hits\, Volume 3 at MATCH
DTSTAMP:20260801T102433Z
DTSTART:20260731T200000Z
DESCRIPTION:The Catastrophic Theatre presents Tamarie’s Greatest Hits\, Vol
	ume 3—marking Houston’s third full decade of an original annual summer mus
	ical created by Tamarie Cooper—at MATCH in Midtown. \nEach year\, this Hou
	ston institution with a cult following debuts a brand new production— show
	casing wildly irreverent scripts\, riotously funny songs\, wackadoodle dan
	ces\, spectacular sets\, large casts of quadruple-threat performers\, a sm
	all but mighty band\, and Tamarie herself. \nEvery ten years\, she creates
	 a greatest hits show\, featuring the best moments from a decade of great 
	moments with a ridiculous new script and a couple brand-spanking new songs
	 to tie the whole thing together. \nAdmission\nTickets are Pay-What-You-Ca
	n\, with a suggested price of $40. Order tickets or learn more. \n  \n \nT
	his Featured Calendar Listing was sponsored by the event organizer and boo
	sted in our calendar with images and more details. \nLearn more about prom
	oting your event\, organization\, business\, or offer across all of our ch
	annels. \n\nhttps://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/the-catastrophic-theat
	re-tamaries-greatest-hits-volume-3-at-match-22/\n\nFrom 365 Things to Do i
	n Houston
URL:https://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/the-catastrophic-theatre-tamari
	es-greatest-hits-volume-3-at-match-22/
LOCATION:MATCH: Midtown Arts & Theater Center Houston\, 3400 Main St\, Hous
	ton\, TX\, 77002\, United States
